Package: POMPG
Title: Pareto-Optimal Multi-Protected-Group Selection Optimization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Q. Chelsea", "Song", , "qianqisong@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends the Pareto-optimal predictor weighting framework of the
    'ParetoR' package (Normal Boundary Intersection) from a single
    adverse-impact protected subgroup to multiple protected subgroups
    simultaneously (PO-MPG). Provides POMA_Focal() for multi-group NBI
    optimization and supporting utilities for selection-system simulation.
